OL,5,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,6,     FJools is joined by the actress
OL,7,     FRachael Stirling.
OL,8,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,9,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,10,     FMusic. 1828, Vienna. Virtuoso
OL,11,     Fviolinist Paganini arrives in the
OL,12,     FAustrian capital and sparks a
OL,13,     Fcraze that spreads across Europe.
OL,14,G1400 Record Review
OL,15,     FAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,16,     Fclassical releases, joined by
OL,17,     FNigel Simeone and pianist Kathryn
OL,18,     FStott, who surveys Beethoven's
OL,19,     F'Spring' Sonata and makes a top
OL,20,     Fchoice.
