OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman presents a curated
OL,7,     Fmix of film scores and
OL,8,     Fsoundtracks. This week, Edith
OL,9,     Fspeaks to Harry Gregson-Williams
OL,10,     Fabout his latest score to Ridley
OL,11,     FScott's The Dog Stars.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by American
OL,14,     Fpianist, activist, and broadcaster
OL,15,     FLara Downes, for a listening
OL,16,     Fparty, including music by Florence
OL,17,     FPrice, Stevie Wonder, and Philip
OL,18,     FGlass.
